  "goodToKnow": "Deprimieren means to depress, to make someone feel low: Das deprimiert mich. Deprimiert means depressed or dejected, and deprimierend depressing: ein deprimierendes Ergebnis. Clinical depression is die Depression; about one in five Germans experiences it at some point, and talking about it has become less taboo. Colloquially, people also say Ich bin down. Perfect without ge-: hat deprimiert."
